ba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T19:23:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033965","verified_at":"2026-10-22T23:23:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5032140-1846651706684925","game_id":"steam-5032140","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo & Release Date","summary":"The world of Cluttermancer: Tidy Up the Nightmare Alley opens its gates!We are launching our first shop! Sort through shovels, grave stones and urns in the Cluttermancer Demo. In the full game, you can explore five different magical shops in Nightmare Alley, where you will find 6,666 items, including wands, books, potions, gravestones, and stolen coffee cups.We will enter Early Access on 30 October. You will be able to explore the first two shops in the Nightmare Alley. More shops will be added ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T16:00:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684925","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5032140-1846651706684686","game_id":"steam-5032140","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.1.09 Patch","summary":"Cluttermancer - Patch Notes0.1.09Thanks for all the feedback so far.NewMenu music in the title screen and the alley, with its own music inside the shopsMusic now fades out and in with the screen transitionsDoor sounds when entering and leaving a shopVersion number in the pause menuA sound when a spell key is pressed but the spell can't be castFixesThe shop completion achievement now also unlocks when loading an already finished shopItems in your hand no longer get stuck in the ceiling after leav","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:13:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684686","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5032140-1846018067925715","game_id":"steam-5032140","kind":"announcement","title":"3,000 Wishlists! 🪄","summary":"We just passed 3,000 Wishlists. This is so awesome! We are currently preparing the Demo! Can´t tell much yet but the demo will be available soon (tm). Feel free to wishlists the game to stay in the loop:Best, Seth, Gino & Linus 📧 Sign up for our Newsletter🎮 Follow us on Steam▶️ Join our Discord","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T10:38:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5032140-1844115010503679","game_id":"steam-5032140","kind":"announcement","title":"2.000 Wishlists","summary":"We just passed 2.000 Wishlists. Thank you so much! We are working on getting the first two shops ready for a demo! Here are a few grave stones we are working on. :) Feel free to wishlists the game to stay in the loop: Best, Seth, Gino & Linus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T09:41:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503679","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:40:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5032140-1842212951310268","game_id":"steam-5032140","kind":"announcement","title":"1.000 Wishlists","summary":"We announced Cluttermancer on Monday and in just one week we got 1.000 Wishlists! You guys are amazing! Thank you so much! Best, Seth, Gino & Linus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T13:50:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstor